title: metarecord:toggle
tags: [[GUI command]] Metarecord
kind: reference
summary: Metarecord: toggle a flag (force: allow writing the reserved mfr_* fields)

`metarecord:toggle force` checks or unchecks the ''force'' box of [[metarecord-detail panel]]: while it is on, the rows of `mfr_*` fields can be edited there, and `metarecord:field` and `metarecord:bulk` may write such a field ([[Reserved fields]], [[Editing metarecords in the GUI]]).
